WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.966 --> 00:00:03.903
ROBOT:
<i> This is a story of automation</i>

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:07.506
<i> and of the people
 lost in the process.</i>

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.276
♪ (TENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:13.179
<i> MAN 1:
 There was this accident.</i>

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.115
A robot killed a man.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.184
MAN 2:<i> It just didn't stop.</i>

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.520
<i> It was the very first death
 in a driverless car.</i>

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:24.023
MAN 3:<i> Any kind of work that
 is fundamentally routine</i>

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:26.025
<i> and repetitive is going
 to disappear</i>

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.028
because AI is going to be
everywhere.

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:31.731
We don't want
to replace the worker,

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.299
<i> we want to support workers.</i>

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:35.801
MAN 4:<i> We're talking about
machines now that are so cheap,</i>

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:38.604
<i> they do exactly what
 a human does with less money.</i>

00:00:39.905 --> 00:00:42.909
MAN 3:<i> Huge numbers of people
feel they are being left behind.</i>

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.277
<i> They're right, they are.</i>

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:47.213
MAN 1:<i> The biggest danger
 of that is the discrediting</i>

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:48.615
<i> of our empathetic responses.</i>

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:52.952
ROBOT:<i> The dynamic between
 robots and humans changed.</i>

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:56.256
<i> You could no longer tell
 where you ended...</i>

00:00:57.189 --> 00:00:58.458
and we began.

